yinliang: switch the PMI8998 WLED off on RequestPowerChange(0)

PRIVATE YINLIANG BRANCH PATCH - deliberately NO numeric prefix.
Mainline 0301 already belongs to the WiFi AI's
0301-polaris-w2c-reset-sequence.patch; do not confuse the two.
If this ever lands in the shared patch repo it must be renamed to
that repo's next sequence number (e.g. 0097-...), never 0301.

Apply AFTER 0062 -> 0245 -> 0294 v2 (see yinliang/README.md).
Touches only sweet_spmi.c / sweet_spmi.h / SweetFramebuffer.cpp.
Zero WiFi files, zero CI dispatched by this patch.

